# Copy to .dev.vars for local `wrangler dev`. That file is gitignored; this one is
# documentation. In production these are set with `wrangler secret put`, never committed.
#
# Both are optional. With neither set the worker still serves /config, which is the only
# endpoint the app needs for rungs 0 through 2.
#
# TRANSCRIPT_API_KEY = supadata-key-here
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY = anthropic-key-here
